  m_Name: Dorothy Gale
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: PebblePouch.Lore::PebblePouch.Lore.Entry
  _id: bff2dcff-df4c-46a2-a793-2f30f4a6a243
  _createdTicks: 639273194265409640
  _modifiedTicks: 639273194317791371
  _category: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8b7b72a809a05de42b9e4e1a9fc3d116, type: 2}
  _glyph: "\U0001F467\uFE0F"
  _subtitle: A little girl from Kansas
  _description: 'Lives on the gray Kansas prairie with [[89b89506-901b-4b79-b60a-bde5d03059f1|Aunt
    Em]], [[87784a10-585d-4189-8540-416bd35e1891|Uncle Henry]] and her dog [[53b4ef1b-67db-4541-90e7-2eb2323dc66e|Toto]].
    A cyclone carries her house into the land of the Munchkins, where it falls on
    the [[0014940d-d5cf-4f17-862b-eba235e5a4de|Wicked Witch of the East]]. To find
    her way home she follows the [[b1203b36-0cef-4107-9678-716a0ddbf578|Yellow Brick
    Road]] to the [[9d4c77c2-5244-4449-b2ef-0ed428ada08e|Emerald City]].


    *The
    player character.*'
